   "sentenceId": 8,
   "he": "וְהַמַּשְׁחִית פְּאַת זְקָנוֹ. תָּנוּ רַבָּנַן: פְּאַת זְקָנוֹ – סוֹף זְקָנוֹ, וְאֵיזֶהוּ סוֹף זְקָנוֹ – שִׁבּוֹלֶת זְקָנוֹ.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: «And one who mars the edge of his beard» is flogged. «The Sages taught: The edge of his beard» is «the extremity of his beard. And what is the extremity of his beard?» It is «the stalk of his beard,» i.e., the five edges of the beard enumerated in the mishna where hair collects in one spot, like grain on stalks."
  }
